{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cice",
  "description": "CICE sea-ice top-level component (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the cesm3_cice6_6_3_22 ice component as an esm 1.3.0 assembly, per the stage1/boundaries.md 1.3 boundary table. Five systems: IceCap (mounted from ./cice_coupling.esm, the med<->ice cap renames, the med2mod/mod2med areacor scaling, and the merge_fluxes export aggregation of ice_import_export.F90), Thermodynamics (./cice_thermodynamics.esm, the BL99 column physics: prep_radiation shortwave/albedo, step_therm1 vertical conduction and surface energy balance, step_therm2 growth/melt/ponds and the ocean heat/fresh/salt fluxes), Dynamics (./cice_dynamics.esm, the EVP momentum balance and stress relaxation of step_dyn_horiz), Transport (./cice_transport.esm, the per-category conservative advection of the incremental-remap scheme), and the inline Control model, which is the ice_step orchestration (CICE_RunMod.F90:109-369 via ice_step_mod.F90) written as algebraic rate rules over one coupling period: the subcycling dt_dyn = dt/ndtd of the dynamics loop (CICE_RunMod.F90:271-281, ice_calendar dt_dyn), and the atmosphere boundary layer of the constant scheme (atmo_boundary_const, icepack_atmo.F90:398-496): wind = sqrt(uatm^2 + vatm^2) (prepare_forcing, ice_forcing.F90:1796), tau = rhoa*0.0012*wind with the components strairx = tau*uatm, strairy = tau*vatm (F90:460-464), shcoef = senscoef*cp_air*rhoa*wind (F90:493) and lhcoef = latncoef*Lsub*rhoa*wind (F90:494, Lheat = Lsub for ice F90:472-476). The coupling array wires the data flow with variable_map param_to_var entries in the ice_step order: the cap state fields (potT, Qa, rhoa, the four shortwave bands, flw, sst, sss, frzmlt, frain, fsnow, uocn, vocn, ss_tltx, ss_tlty) into Thermodynamics and Dynamics; the transport-owned mass states aicen/vicen/vsnon into Thermodynamics, Dynamics, and the cap aggregation; the thermodynamics-owned enthalpy states qicen/qsnon into the Transport tracers; the dynamics-owned velocity uvel/vvel into Transport and the full ocean stress taux/tauy into the cap's Fioi_taux/tauy sign flip and the thermodynamics' ustar; and the per-category thermodynamics fluxes and albedos into the cap's export aggregation. Deferred to stage 3 (documented in the subcomponent descriptions and README.md): the Tsfc implicit surface-energy-balance solve (carried as a free parameter), the incremental-remap discretization of the transport PDEs (EarthSciDiscretizations lowering), the kstrength = 1 Rothrock ridging and the kdyn/ktherm alternates, the similarity atmbndy scheme, the per-band Fioi_swpen_* fields, and the wave/aerosol/isotope exports. The shape-mismatched variable_map edges (3x5 dynamics/transport to the single-cell Thermodynamics/IceCap) carry faq full-map broadcast and single-cell select transforms (index of the traced cell (2,2) = global (3,5) inside a faq over ncat; the native compiler requires the full-rank index form), and the tests block pins the coupled assembly at the step-1 export-time state (17 assertions: the export-state chain through the coupling, the constant-scheme Control chain, and the broadcast ocean/tilt stress). The whole-coupling-period trace over [0, 3600] from the cold start remains a stage-3 concern. See README.md 'Testing'. Reference: stage1/cesm/components/cice/src/cicecore/drivers/nuopc/cmeps/.",
   "tags": [
    "cryosphere",
    "sea-ice",
    "cice",
    "cesm",
    "assembly",
    "coupling"
   ],
   "created": "2026-11-01T00:00:00Z",
   "authors": [
    "EqESM project contributors"
   ],
   "references": [
    {
     "citation": "Hunke, E. C., Allard, R., Bailey, D. A., Blain, P., Craig, A., Dupont, F., ... & Roberts, A. F. (2023). CICE-Consortium Icepack v1.2.4 and CICE v6.3.22: documentation and user's guide. Los Alamos National Laboratory (LA-UR-23-31851)."
    },
    {
     "citation": "CESM (Community Earth System Model), ESCOMP/CESM: CICE sea-ice source (cesm3_cice6_6_3_22) - CICE_RunMod.F90, ice_step_mod.F90, ice_forcing.F90, icepack_atmo.F90 - the reference implementation these components are transcribed from.",
     "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CESM"
    },
    {
     "citation": "EarthSciModels - the authoritative .esm corpus this component lives in.",
     "url": "https://github.com/EarthSciML/EarthSciModels"
    }
   ]
 },
 "solver": {
  "stiffness": "high",
  "time_span": {
   "start": 0,
   "end": 3600
  },
  "external": "cice.run.json"
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "cell": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_CELL"
  },
  "ncat": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_CAT"
  },
  "ice_layer": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_ILYR"
  },
  "snow_layer": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_SLYR"
  },
  "i": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_I"
  },
  "j": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_J"
  }
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "N_CELL": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 1,
   "description": "number of ice grid cells in the stage-2 skeleton (one cell; the full model runs the block-decomposed B grid), [-]"
  },
  "N_I": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 3,
   "description": "number of T cells along the B-grid x axis of the traced subdomain (global cells 2..4 of the stage-1 dump; declared here so the mounted dynamics/transport grids fold to the traced 3x5 size), [-]"
  },
  "N_J": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 5,
   "description": "number of T cells along the B-grid y axis (global cells 4..8 of the dump; see N_I), [-]"
  },
  "N_CAT": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 5,
   "description": "number of ice thickness categories (namelist ncat = 5), [-]"
  },
  "N_ILYR": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 8,
   "description": "number of ice layers (D-class namelist nilyr = 8), [-]"
  },
  "N_SLYR": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 3,
   "description": "number of snow layers (D-class namelist nslyr = 3), [-]"
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "Transport": {
   "ref": "./cice_transport.esm"
  },
  "Dynamics": {
   "ref": "./cice_dynamics.esm"
  },
  "Thermodynamics": {
   "ref": "./cice_thermodynamics.esm"
  },
  "IceCap": {
   "ref": "./cice_coupling.esm"
  },
  "Control": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./cice_templates.esm"
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "dt_dyn": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "dynamics timestep of the ndtd subcycle loop: dt_dyn = dt/ndtd (ice_calendar dt_dyn, passed to step_dyn_horiz, CICE_RunMod.F90:271-281), [s]"
    },
    "wind": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "wind speed at the lowest model level: wind = sqrt(uatm^2 + vatm^2) (prepare_forcing, ice_forcing.F90:1796, 1819), [m/s]"
    },
    "tau": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "description": "atmosphere-ice momentum stress magnitude of the constant boundary-layer scheme: tau = rhoa*0.0012*wind (atmo_boundary_const, icepack_atmo.F90:460), [N/m2]"
    },
    "strairx": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/s^3",
     "description": "x air-ice stress at T points: strairx = tau*uatm (atmo_boundary_const, icepack_atmo.F90:463; the per-category strairxn of step_therm1 is identical across categories - no Tsfc dependence - so the merge_fluxes aggregation of icepack_flux.F90:187-189 collapses to this single value). The Fortran omits the /wind direction-cosine normalization (the vmag division is commented out, F90:328-329), so the transcription carries the dimension kg/s^3 of the active code; the quirk is logged in README.md, [kg/s3]"
    },
    "strairy": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/s^3",
     "description": "y air-ice stress at T points: strairy = tau*vatm (F90:464; see strairx for the missing /wind normalization), [kg/s3]"
    },
    "shcoef": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2/K",
     "description": "sensible-heat transfer coefficient: shcoef = senscoef*cp_air*rhoa*wind (atmo_boundary_const, icepack_atmo.F90:493; senscoef = 0.0012, cp_air = 1005), [W/m2/K]"
    },
    "lhcoef": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "latent-heat transfer coefficient: lhcoef = latncoef*Lsub*rhoa*wind (atmo_boundary_const, icepack_atmo.F90:494 with Lheat = Lsub = 2.8347e6 for ice -- the nuopc-cap value, ice_comp_nuopc.F90:415-450, bugs.md #11 -- vs 2.835e6, F90:472-476; latncoef = 0.0015), [W/m2]"
    },
    "dt": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "s",
     "default": 3600.0,
     "description": "coupling/thermodynamics timestep (namelist dt = 3600 s; the step_therm1/2 column physics runs once per step), [s]"
    },
    "ndtd": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "number of dynamics subcycles per step (namelist ndtd = 1), [-]"
    },
    "uatm": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "x wind velocity at zlvl (wired from the cap import Sa_u), [m/s]"
    },
    "vatm": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "y wind velocity at zlvl (wired from the cap import Sa_v), [m/s]"
    },
    "rhoa": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^3",
     "default": 1.2,
     "description": "air density (wired from the cap import Sa_dens or the Sa_pbot branch), [kg/m3]"
    }
   },
   "equations": [
    {
     "lhs": "dt_dyn",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "/",
      "args": [
       "dt",
       "ndtd"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "wind",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "sqrt",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "^",
          "args": [
           "uatm",
           2
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "^",
          "args": [
           "vatm",
           2
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "tau",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "atmo_constant_tau",
      "bindings": {
       "rhoa": "rhoa",
       "wind": "wind"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "strairx",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "tau",
       "uatm"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "strairy",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "tau",
       "vatm"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "shcoef",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "atmo_constant_shcoef",
      "bindings": {
       "rhoa": "rhoa",
       "wind": "wind"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "lhcoef",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "atmo_constant_lhcoef",
      "bindings": {
       "rhoa": "rhoa",
       "wind": "wind",
       "Lheat": {"op": "const", "args": [], "value": 2834700.0, "units": "J/kg"}
      }
     }
    }
   ],
  "tests": [
  {
    "id": "assembly_exports_dynamics_step1_cell3_5",
    "description": "Instantaneous assembly pins of the step-1 export-time state (the end of the first coupling period; the run's step-1 exports aggregate the entry(2) state to round-off, so the export pins are exact): the traced cell local (2,2) = global (3,5). Initial conditions: Transport aicen/vicen/vsnon = the post-step-1 advected field, cice_thermo_state.csv step-2 entry rows at the 15 cells; Dynamics uvel/vvel = the export-time velocity field, cice_transport_state.csv step-1 t_entr uvel/vvel at the 15 U points (the advection uses the post-dynamics velocity; the U(4,4) = (0,0) convention cell local (3,1) is zero in the dump); Thermodynamics qicen/qsnon = the step-2 entry column state at (3,5). Parameter overrides: Thermodynamics Tsfc = the entry(2) Tsfc tracer (the surface temperature the Si_t export aggregates; the converged-solve Tsfcn is a different quantity, 0.7 K warmer, so the flux exports are not pinned here), albedos = the step-1 cice_albedo.csv rows at (3,5) (export-time albedos); the B-grid geometry dxT/dyT/cxp/cyp/cxm/cym/dxhy/dyhx (cice_evp_stress.csv step-2 ksub1 corner-1 rows) with HTE/HTN = (3cyp-cym)/4, (3cxp-cxm)/4 and the momentum-dump aiX/uarear (cice_evp_momentum.csv step-2 ksub1; U(4,4) missing from the dump, zeroed by the (0,0) convention); IceCap raw CMEPS fields = the step-1 (3,5) cice_run_imports.csv values inverted through the import equations (Sa_u = uatm, Sa_v = vatm, Sa_dens = rhoa, So_u = uocn, So_v = vocn, So_dhdx = ss_tltx, So_dhdy = ss_tlty) with med2mod_areacor = the row's areacor and mod2med_areacor = 1/areacor (the step-1 (3,5) export rows carry the inverse). Pins against cice_run_exports.csv step-1 (3,5): the export chain through the coupling (Transport->Thermodynamics/IceCap single-cell selects and the Thermodynamics->IceCap Tsfc/albedo edges) Si_ifrac/Si_vice/Si_vsno/Si_snowh/Si_t and the albedo aggregation Si_avsdr/Si_anidr/Si_avsdf/Si_anidf. Formulation pins (transcribed from the same inputs; no dump column is directly comparable): Faii_taux/Faii_tauy = strairxT/aice*areacor with the constant-scheme Control chain strairx = tau*uatm, tau = rhoa*0.0012*wind (icepack_atmo.F90:460-461; the run's similarity-scheme export differs, a stage-3 concern); the ocean-ice stress Dynamics.taux/tauy at U(1,1) and U(2,2) (the traced cell's NE corner), vrel = aiX*rhow*Cw*sqrt((uocn-uvel)^2+(vocn-vvel)^2) with rhow = 1026, Cw = 0.00536 and the broadcast step-1 (3,5) uocn/vocn; and the tilt stress strtltx/strtlty at T(2,2) as wiring pins of the ss_tltx/ss_tlty broadcast (the traced-cell So_dhdx/So_dhdy imports are identically zero in this run).",
    "time_span": {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.0
    },
    "tolerance": {
      "rel": 1e-12,
      "abs": 0.0
    },
    "parameter_overrides": {
